---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Case Study: Chemical Processing Unit, Ankleshwar | 2MW Pure Wind | OnLoop Energy" description="Case Study: 2MW Pure Wind system for a chemical processing plant in Ankleshwar, India. ₹22L monthly bill offset by 63% with ₹6.0L/month savings and ~4.0 years payback.">
<div>

  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="hero hero--short">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
          Case Study Detail
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          Chemical Processing Unit, Ankleshwar<br />
          <span class="hero__title-highlight">2MW Pure Wind Turbine System</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">Ankleshwar, India • Chemical & Speciality Processing Industry</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Quick Key Numbers Bar */}
  <div style="background: var(--color-bg-secondary); border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding: var(--space-6) 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-4" style="text-align: center; gap: var(--space-4);">
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">System Capacity</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">2MW Pure Wind</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Bill Offset</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-primary);">63% Offset</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Savings</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #10b981;">₹6.0 Lakhs / mo</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Payback Period</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">~4.0 Years</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Main Case Study Content */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
    <div class="container container--narrow">

      {/* Facility Overview */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Facility Overview</h2>
        <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-base); color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;">
          Operating in Ankleshwar, India — a prime chemical industrial hub — this facility produces specialty organic intermediates and specialty chemicals. Operating 24/7 continuous reactors, effluent treatment plants (ETP), and cooling chillers, the facility recorded an average baseline electricity utility bill of <strong>₹22 Lakhs</strong> per month.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* The Challenge */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10); background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">The Challenge</h2>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>Continuous Chemical Processing:</strong> Reaction vessels and cooling chillers require 24/7 unbroken power security to prevent runaway reactions.</li>
          <li><strong>Sensitive to Voltage Fluctuations:</strong> Industrial grid trips caused control system resets and expensive batch spoilage.</li>
          <li><strong>Corrosive Industrial Atmosphere:</strong> High chemical fumes prohibited rooftop solar mounting due to rapid panel degradation risks.</li>
          <li><strong>High Outage Downtime Costs:</strong> Averaged 15 hours of grid outage downtime monthly, driving heavy diesel generator backup bills.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* The Solution */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10); background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">The Solution</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          OnLoop Energy deployed a <strong>2MW Pure Captive Wind Turbine System</strong> with anti-corrosion marine grade coatings, situated outside the plant's corrosive vapor zone.
        </p>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>24/7 Wind Power Generation:</strong> Direct-drive PMA turbines deliver continuous clean energy around the clock.</li>
          <li><strong>Perimeter Installation:</strong> Placed away from plant chemical exhaust vents for maximum structural longevity.</li>
          <li><strong>Grid Synchronized Stability:</strong> Advanced power electronics stabilize voltage frequency, protecting sensitive process chillers.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Before vs After Results Table */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Before vs After Performance</h2>
        <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
          <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
            <thead>
              <tr style="background: var(--color-primary); color: #ffffff; text-align: left; font-size: 14px;">
                <th style="padding: 14px 18px;">Metric</th>
                <th style="padding: 14px 18px;">Before OnLoop</th>
                <th style="padding: 14px 18px;">After OnLoop</th>
                <th style="padding: 14px 18px;">Net Impact</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-primary);">
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 600;">Grid Power Reliance</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; color: #ef4444;">100% Grid Reliance</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; color: #10b981; font-weight: 600;">~42% Grid Reliance</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981;">58% Grid Reduction</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 600;">Monthly Electricity Bill</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;">₹22.0 Lakhs</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #10b981;">₹16.0 Lakhs</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981;">₹6.0 Lakhs Saved / mo</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 600;">Power Outage Downtime</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; color: #ef4444;">15 Hours / month</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; color: #10b981; font-weight: 600;">2 Hours / month</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981;">87% Downtime Cut</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Financial Breakdown */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10); background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Financial Breakdown & ROI</h2>
        <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-4); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Turnkey System Investment</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">~₹10.5 Crores</strong>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Annual Tariff Savings</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #10b981;">₹72.0 Lakhs / year</strong>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Estimated Payback Period</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--color-primary);">~4.0 Years</strong>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">20-Year Lifetime Savings</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #10b981;">~₹8.5 Crores</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Back to Projects & CTA */}
      <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/projects" class="btn btn--secondary">
          ← Back to All Projects
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
          Get Your Free Savings Analysis →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
